From 493e9a300701230c7ee8effbabceea625ce5bd67 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DaffyDabz <daffydabz@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 13:03:36 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 006/371] pirates: client - Panda 1.11 fixes (Sept 2026
 family-server fixes)

- PiratesClientRepository: handle the avatarZoneChanged message Panda3D 1.11's
  grid sends, and open interest on the surrounding cells so players one cell
  apart can see each other.
- SeaPatch: call update() on the patch node, not the NodePath.
- GameOptions, PiratesBase: always open a borderless window the size of the
  desktop, never exclusive fullscreen.
- Cutscene, CutsceneActor: keep a soft fill light when ENV_OFF leaves the
  scene black; put the pirate back safely when the grid cell he stood in was
  removed during the cutscene; LeaveTunnel counts like EnterTunnel.
- MuzzleFlame: a pooled flame that would reparent into a cycle no longer
  kills the interval loop and crashes the game.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
